{"pull": {"id": "number:20631", "number": 20631, "title": "KAFKA-19542: Consumer.close() does not remove all added sensors from Metrics", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-10-02T17:36:44Z", "closed_at": "2025-12-02T01:40:37Z", "merged_at": null, "user": {"login": "kirktrue", "id": 92057, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjkyMDU3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92057?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue", "html_url": "https://github.com/kirktrue", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/kirktrue/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The intention of the `Consumer` API is that after `close()`, `metrics()`\nshould return an empty map of metrics. The lifecycle management of the\nvarious metrics managers in the consumer is inconsistent. Some managers\nremove all the metrics that were created, some registries remove some of\nthem, and some don't make any effort to remove the metrics at all.\n\nThis change introduces `AbstractConsumerMetricsManager` as a shared base\nclass for consumer metrics managers, consolidating the steps of metric\nregistration and cleanup logic, as well as unit tests to ensure that the\ndifferent metrics managers perform the cleanup step.\n", "labels": [{"id": 851033232, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4NTEwMzMyMzI=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/consumer", "name": "consumer", "color": "bf6a03", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7491388177, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABvoWDEQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/clients", "name": "clients", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20631"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_kirktrue_is_pr.json"}